cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SILAS: SACLA Imaging, Logging and Analysis Suite"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Nikolaj
    family-names: Klinkby
    affiliation: "Aarhus University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-0317-116X"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-20"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nklinkby/silas-sacla"
abstract: >-
  Python tools for pump-probe experiments at the SACLA X-ray free-electron laser (BL3):
  a run and scan logger, live and offline MPCCD viewers, energy calibration, threshold and
  dark corrections, a timing-tool analysis with per-shot arrival-time correction, ROI scan
  analysis online and on the SACLA HPC, and full-frame reductions of every detector pixel.
keywords:
  - SACLA
  - X-ray free-electron laser
  - pump-probe
  - MPCCD
  - timing tool
  - data analysis
